{"id":"chatcmpl-c8b813c3-af2c-4839-9b6c-c8bf6363a849","object":"chat.completion","created":1795247500,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a domain-expert delegation pattern: rather than reasoning directly about image content, the agent routes a structured anatomical question to a specialized tool and accepts its localized answer. The key abstraction is translating a multiple-choice laterality question into a spatial-anatomy query (anterior vs. posterior on a lateral projection) that the expert can resolve unambiguously.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question requires interpreting specialized visual/domain data, delegate to a domain-specific expert tool with a precisely scoped question rather than reasoning from general knowledge.\",\n    \"Convert abstract answer options (e.g., 'left' vs. 'right') into concrete spatial or anatomical descriptors the expert can directly verify, then map the expert's finding back to the option label.\",\n    \"Include the projection/view context (e.g., lateral vs. frontal) in the expert query, since laterality interpretation depends on the imaging convention used.\",\n    \"Ask the expert for both presence and localization in a single query so the answer directly discriminates between the provided options.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"State the imaging view/projection explicitly; translate laterality into anatomical landmarks (anterior/posterior, left/right) before querying; confirm presence and location together.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice with spatial options\": \"Rephrase options as verifiable spatial predicates, query the specialist once, then map the returned location to the matching option label.\",\n    \"Tool delegation\": \"Scope each expert call to a single discriminating question that resolves the ambiguity between options, avoiding open-ended queries.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the expert's reported location maps correctly to the option label under the stated imaging convention.\",\n    \"Verify the query explicitly asked about both presence and laterality so the answer discriminates between all options.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":415,"total_tokens":802,"completion_tokens":387,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":415},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":387}}}